        "translator": "K. M. K. Murthy / Desiraju Hanumanta Rao",
        "text": "In the company of those ministers, who are conducive to the strategies, interested in the king and subjects as well, skilful and efficient ones, he that King Dasharatha obtained brilliance, like the rising Sun along with resplendent sunrays. [1-7-24]"
      }
